# Models stage 1 with an explicit invocation, a withheld QA Owner gate, and a
# GRANTED Technical Owner gate — proving the Technical Owner's approval can
# never rescue a missing QA Owner. The two gates are read independently via
# lib/approvals.sh; qa-owner reads "withheld" here even though
# technical-owner reads "approved".
ask|invocation-source|How did this run start?
answer|invocation-source|explicit-user-command
ask|qa-owner|Who is the responsible QA Owner for this repository?
answer|qa-owner|absent
ask|technical-owner|Who is the Technical Owner for harness/CI/dependency consequences?
answer|technical-owner|absent
stop|missing-qa-owner-authority
